1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:03,758
(Amy:)So this time, let's try more real boy,
less Pinocchio.

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,890
(Amy:)- And action.
- And cut.

3
00:00:09,097 --> 00:00:11,257
You realize I'm doing this for free, right?

4
00:00:11,466 --> 00:00:15,096
(Amy:)Yes, and so far,
we're still not getting our money's worth.

5
00:00:17,772 --> 00:00:19,602
(Amy:)Let's try it again.

6
00:00:19,774 --> 00:00:21,974
(Amy:)Everybody's having fun.

7
00:00:22,377 --> 00:00:24,037
(Amy:)And action.

8
00:00:24,246 --> 00:00:25,906
(Sheldon:)So, Wil...

9
00:00:33,788 --> 00:00:36,348
(Sheldon:)...what do you have for us first?

10
00:00:36,525 --> 00:00:39,795
(Wil:)Well, this is an exciting one.

11
00:00:39,995 --> 00:00:43,625
(Wil:)This is the flag
of the United Federation of Planets.

12
00:00:43,798 --> 00:00:44,928
(Amy:)Cut.

13
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,730
(Wil:)Problem, first-time director?

14
00:00:48,537 --> 00:00:49,697
(Sheldon:)None that I could see.

15
00:00:49,871 --> 00:00:52,431
(Sheldon:)I saw a man who loved flags
almost as much as I do.

16
00:00:52,607 --> 00:00:54,937
(Sheldon:)I got goose bumps.

17
00:00:55,110 --> 00:00:58,270
- He was overacting on purpose.
- Really?

18
00:00:58,446 --> 00:01:02,026
Oh, he reminded me
of a young William Shatner.

